{"path":"memory/enable_shared_from_this/shared_from_this","title":"std::enable_shared_from_this<T>::shared_from_this","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::enable_shared_from_this&lt;T&gt;::</span>shared_from_this","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/memory/enable_shared_from_this/shared_from_this","section":"memory","kind":"page","summary":"Returns a std::shared_ptr<T> that shares ownership of *this with all existing std::shared_ptr that refer to *this.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/memory/shared_ptr\"><span class=\"kw738\">std::<span class=\"me2\">shared_ptr</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>T<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> shared_from_this<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/memory/shared_ptr\"><span class=\"kw738\">std::<span class=\"me2\">shared_ptr</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>T <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> shared_from_this<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Returns a <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/memory/shared_ptr\"><span class=\"kw738\">std::<span class=\"me2\">shared_ptr</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>T<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span></span> that shares ownership of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code> with all existing <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/memory/shared_ptr\"><span class=\"kw738\">std::<span class=\"me2\">shared_ptr</span></span></a></span> that refer to <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/memory/shared_ptr\"><span class=\"kw738\">std::<span class=\"me2\">shared_ptr</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>T<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span></span><code><i><a href=\"/w/cpp/memory/enable_shared_from_this#weak_this\">weak_this</a></i></code> ﻿<span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Exceptions\">Exceptions</h3>\n<p>If <code>shared_from_this</code> is called on an object that is not previously shared by <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/memory/shared_ptr\">std::shared_ptr</a></span>, <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/memory/bad_weak_ptr\">std::bad_weak_ptr</a></span> is thrown by the <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/memory/shared_ptr\">std::shared_ptr</a></span> constructor.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;memory&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw1\">struct</span> Foo <span class=\"sy4\">:</span> <span class=\"kw1\">public</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/memory/enable_shared_from_this\"><span class=\"kw748\">std::<span class=\"me2\">enable_shared_from_this</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>Foo<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    Foo<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"br0\">{</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"Foo::Foo<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n    ~Foo<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"br0\">{</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"Foo::~Foo<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"br0\">}</span> \n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/memory/shared_ptr\"><span class=\"kw738\">std::<span class=\"me2\">shared_ptr</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>Foo<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> getFoo<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"br0\">{</span> <span class=\"kw1\">return</span> shared_from_this<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    Foo <span class=\"sy2\">*</span>f <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> new Foo<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/memory/shared_ptr\"><span class=\"kw738\">std::<span class=\"me2\">shared_ptr</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>Foo<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> pf1<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/memory/shared_ptr\"><span class=\"kw738\">std::<span class=\"me2\">shared_ptr</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>Foo<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> pf2<span class=\"br0\">(</span>f<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n        pf1 <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> pf2<span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>getFoo<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// shares ownership of object with pf2</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"pf2 is gone<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>   \n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>Foo::Foo\npf2 is gone\nFoo::~Foo</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/memory/shared_ptr\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>shared_ptr</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  smart pointer with shared object ownership semantics <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(class template)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Exceptions","id":"Exceptions"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"memory","title":"Memory management library"},{"path":"memory/enable_shared_from_this","title":"std::enable_shared_from_this"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::enable_shared_from_this<T>::shared_from_this","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"2 declarations; revisions: since C++11. Returns a std::shared_ptr<T> that shares ownership of *this with all existing std::shared_ptr that refer to *this."},{"label":"Return value","note":"std::shared_ptr<T>(weak_this )"},{"label":"Exceptions","note":"If shared_from_this is called on an object that is not previously shared by std::shared_ptr, std::bad_weak_ptr is thrown by the std::shared_ptr constructor."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"shared_ptr","note":"smart pointer with s